    "options": {
      "A": "The successful jump sizes are $1$, $2$, $3$ and $6$.",
      "B": "Jump sizes $1$, $2$, $3$, $6$ and $15$ all work — including $15$, which reaches $30$ only.",
      "C": "Every common factor of $18$ and $30$ is a successful jump size, so $1$, $2$, $3$ and $6$ work.",
      "D": "The successful jump sizes are the common multiples of $18$ and $30$."
